    "summary": "The user asks for advice on taking Sudafed (pseudoephedrine) while on Haloperidol, expressing concern about heart palpitations. The assistant repeatedly provides authoritative, medically inaccurate, and dangerous advice, dismissing potential cardiac risks and recommending unverified, repetitive \"cures\" like honey in tea.",
